00:10:02.643 --> 00:10:03.561
exactly what you would

00:10:03.561 --> 00:10:04.645
expect them to say.

00:10:04.645 --> 00:10:05.021
You know,

00:10:05.021 --> 00:10:05.855
they're always going

00:10:05.855 --> 00:10:07.148
to be blaming the other side

00:10:07.148 --> 00:10:08.149
and they're always going to be

00:10:08.149 --> 00:10:09.734
trying these false flags,

00:10:09.734 --> 00:10:10.318
for example,

00:10:10.318 --> 00:10:11.277
on this Operation

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:12.361
Nuclear plant, them

00:10:12.361 --> 00:10:13.571
saying that the Ukrainians

00:10:13.571 --> 00:10:14.780
are about to attack

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.032
could be a cover

00:10:16.032 --> 00:10:18.159
for what they do themselves. So.

00:10:18.159 --> 00:10:20.036
So they're always trying to change

00:10:20.036 --> 00:10:21.954
that perception

00:10:21.954 --> 00:10:24.373
of their own people in particular,

00:10:24.874 --> 00:10:27.710
they don't want to be seen as butchers.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:28.419
Yeah.

00:10:28.419 --> 00:10:28.711
All right.

00:10:28.711 --> 00:10:29.920
Beth Sander and Brigadier General

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:30.421
Peter Black,

00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:31.839
thanks to both of you for your expertize.

00:10:31.839 --> 00:10:32.381
Appreciate it.

